  "goodToKnow": "Die Abwanderung is migration away or an exodus: die Abwanderung aus ländlichen Regionen, die Abwanderung von Talenten (brain drain). After 1990, around two million people moved from eastern to western Germany, many of them young women. The opposite is die Zuwanderung. Abwandern also applies to customers and voters: Wähler wandern zu anderen Parteien ab. Plural: die Abwanderungen."
